<title>THAILAND: Thai stocks fall on rumours Amnuay has quit.</title>
<headline>Thai stocks fall on rumours Amnuay has quit.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-06-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Thai stocks slumped on Wednesday on speculation that finance minister Amnuay Viravan had submitted his resignation.</p>
<p>Amnuay's office declined to comment on the talk when contacted by Reuters.</p>
